sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI as Chat Interface
    participant Client as LiveVoiceClient
    participant API as Gemini Live API

    Note over User, API: Push-to-Talk Cycle
    User->>UI: Press and Hold PTT
    UI->>Client: setStreaming(true)
    loop While PTT Held
        Client->>API: Stream Audio Chunks
        API-->>Client: Real-time Transcription
    end
    User->>UI: Release PTT
    UI->>Client: setStreaming(false)

    Note over API, Client: Automatic Response
    API->>API: Generate Audio and Text
    par Audio Stream
        API-->>Client: modelTurn (Audio)
        Client->>User: Play Audio
    and Text Stream (Missing)
        API-->>Client: modelTurn (Text)
        Client--xUI: Update Chat Log (Not Implemented)
    end

    Note over API, UI: History Queue
    API-->>Client: Final Transcription (User)
    Client-->>UI: Add to VoiceQueue
